Build a widget/storefront feature for QuizSnap: $ARGUMENTS

## Pre-Flight (Read First)
1. Read `CLAUDE.md` Section 3 — `extensions/quiz-widget/` folder structure
2. Read `CLAUDE.md` Law 5 (CORS on every api.* response)
