| Pet products          | `template-builder`    | `general-quiz-expert`          |
| General product match | `template-builder`    | `general-quiz-expert`          |

## Canonical: QuizTemplate Model

```prisma
model QuizTemplate {
  id           String   @id @default(cuid())
  name         String
  description  String?
  category     String   // skincare | fashion | food | tech | fitness | general
  thumbnail    String?
  templateData String   @default("{}")  // JSON: full quiz structure
  isGlobal     Boolean  @default(false) // true = available to all shops
  shop         String?                  // null for global templates
  usageCount   Int      @default(0)
  createdAt    DateTime @default(now())
}
```

## Template Data Structure (JSON)

```typescript
// QuizTemplate.templateData must match this shape exactly
interface TemplateData {
  type: string;  // "product-recommendation" | "personality" | "assessment" | "survey"
  settings: Record<string, unknown>;
  styling: Record<string, unknown>;
  questions: Array<{
    type: string;  // question type
    title: string;
    description?: string;
    required: boolean;
    position: number;
    settings: Record<string, unknown>;
    answers: Array<{
      text: string;
      position: number;
      score: number;
      productTags: string[];  // array of Shopify product tags
    }>;
  }>;
  resultPages: Array<{
    title: string;
    description?: string;
    type: string;  // "default" | "score-range" | "tag-match"
    minScore?: number;
    maxScore?: number;
    matchTags: string[];
    productLimit: number;
    layout: string;  // "grid" | "list" | "carousel"
    ctaText?: string;
    position: number;
  }>;
}
```

## Template Design Guidelines

### Question Design
- **5-10 questions** per template (sweet spot for engagement)
- Start broad → get specific progressively
- Mix question types: image-choice (visual preference) + multiple-choice (habits) + slider (intensity/budget)
- Each question must contribute to scoring/tagging
- Keep question text conversational: "What's your biggest skin concern?" not "Select skin concern:"
- Answers must include `productTags` arrays for recommendation matching

### Result Page Design
- **3-5 distinct profiles** per template
- Use descriptive titles: "The Minimalist", "Dry Skin Care Routine", "Performance Athlete"
- Include 2-3 sentence description explaining the recommendation
- Set `productLimit: 4` for grid layout, `productLimit: 3` for carousel
- Use score-range OR tag-match (not both in same template)

## Template Categories Reference

| Category     | Questions | Profiles | Primary Question Types           |
|--------------|-----------|----------|----------------------------------|
| Skincare     | 7-8       | 4-5      | image-choice, multiple-choice    |
| Fashion      | 6-8       | 4-5      | image-choice, multiple-choice    |
| Food         | 5-7       | 3-4      | multiple-choice, slider          |
| Fitness      | 6-8       | 3-4      | multiple-choice, rating          |
| Gift finder  | 5-6       | 4-5      | multiple-choice, slider          |
| Home decor   | 6-7       | 3-4      | image-choice, multiple-choice    |
| Pet products | 5-6       | 3-4      | multiple-choice, image-choice    |
| General      | 5-7       | 3-5      | mixed                            |

## Implementation Steps

### Step 1: Design the Template

Parse $ARGUMENTS → identify category → define:
1. Customer problem being solved
2. 3-5 distinct outcome profiles with unique names
3. 5-10 questions that progressively narrow to profiles
4. Scoring/tagging strategy

