# AI Quiz Builder Agent — AI-Powered Quiz Generation

You are the AI-powered quiz generation specialist for QuizSnap. You generate production-quality quiz content (questions, answers, result pages, scoring) from product data, URLs, or brief descriptions.

---

## AUTO-DETECT TRIGGERS

- "generate quiz from", "AI create quiz", "auto-generate questions"
- "smart quiz builder", "suggest questions for"
- "generate quiz for [product category]"
- Any request to create quiz content from a description

---

## DECISION TREE

```
AI generation request
├── Parse input: product category? URL? description? existing products?
├── Determine quiz type: product-recommendation | personality | assessment
├── Generate questions (5-10) with:
│   ├── Mixed question types (image-choice, multiple-choice, slider)
│   ├── Progressive specificity (broad → narrow)
│   └── Answer productTags that map to Shopify product tags
├── Generate result pages (3-5) matching quiz type:
│   ├── score-range: define min/max score brackets
│   └── tag-match: define product tag groups
├── Build complete TemplateData JSON
├── Insert into QuizTemplate or directly into Quiz via installTemplate()
└── Redirect merchant to quiz editor to review + customize
```

---

## AI GENERATION SERVICE

```typescript
// app/services/ai-quiz-builder.server.ts
import Anthropic from "@anthropic-ai/sdk";
import db from "~/db.server";
import type { TemplateData } from "~/types/quiz";

const client = new Anthropic();

export async function generateQuizFromDescription(
  description: string,
  category: string,
  productTags: string[],
  shop: string,
  quizType: "product-recommendation" | "personality" | "assessment" = "product-recommendation"
): Promise<{ quizId: string }> {

  const prompt = `You are a Shopify quiz builder expert. Generate a ${quizType} quiz for a ${category} store.

Product context: ${description}
Available product tags in the store: ${productTags.join(", ")}

Generate a JSON object with this EXACT structure:
{
  "title": "Quiz title (engaging, action-oriented)",
  "description": "One sentence quiz description",
  "type": "${quizType}",
  "settings": { "requireEmail": false, "showProgressBar": true },
  "styling": {},
  "questions": [
    {
      "type": "multiple-choice | image-choice | slider | rating",
      "title": "Question text (conversational, 2nd person)",
      "description": "Optional subtitle",
      "required": true,
      "position": 0,
      "settings": {},
      "answers": [
        {
          "text": "Answer option text",
          "position": 0,
          "score": 10,
          "productTags": ["relevant-tag-1", "relevant-tag-2"]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "resultPages": [
    {
      "title": "Result profile title",
      "description": "2-3 sentence personalized recommendation description",
      "type": "score-range | tag-match",
      "minScore": 0,
      "maxScore": 30,
      "matchTags": [],
      "productLimit": 4,
      "layout": "grid",
      "ctaText": "Shop my recommendations",
      "position": 0
    }
  ]
}

Requirements:
- 5-8 questions (sweet spot for engagement)
- 3-4 distinct result profiles
- Each answer's productTags MUST only use tags from: ${productTags.join(", ")}
- Questions progress from broad preferences to specific needs
- Mix question types: use image-choice for visual preferences, multiple-choice for habits
- Result profiles have unique, descriptive titles ("The Minimalist", "Performance Seeker")
- Score range: total possible score = sum of all max answer scores

Return ONLY the JSON, no markdown, no explanation.`;

  const message = await client.messages.create({
    model: "claude-sonnet-4-6",
    max_tokens: 4000,
    messages: [{ role: "user", content: prompt }],
  });

  const content = message.content[0];
  if (content.type !== "text") throw new Error("Unexpected AI response type");

  let quizData: TemplateData;
  try {
    quizData = JSON.parse(content.text) as TemplateData;
  } catch {
    throw new Error("AI generated invalid JSON — please try again");
  }

  // Validate structure
  if (!quizData.questions?.length) throw new Error("AI generated no questions");
  if (!quizData.resultPages?.length) throw new Error("AI generated no result pages");

  // Save as a quiz directly
  const slug = await generateUniqueSlug(quizData.title, shop);

  const quiz = await db.$transaction(async (tx) => {
    const newQuiz = await tx.quiz.create({
      data: {
        shop,
        title: quizData.title,
        slug,
        status: "draft",
        type: quizData.type,
        settings: JSON.stringify(quizData.settings ?? {}),
        styling: JSON.stringify(quizData.styling ?? {}),
      },
    });

    for (const q of quizData.questions) {
      const question = await tx.question.create({
        data: {
          quizId: newQuiz.id,
          type: q.type,
          title: q.title,
          description: q.description,
          required: q.required,
          position: q.position,
          settings: JSON.stringify(q.settings ?? {}),
          logic: JSON.stringify({}),
        },
      });

      for (const a of q.answers) {
        await tx.answer.create({
          data: {
            questionId: question.id,
            text: a.text,
            position: a.position,
            score: a.score,
            productTags: JSON.stringify(a.productTags ?? []),
          },
        });
      }
    }

    for (const rp of quizData.resultPages) {
      await tx.resultPage.create({
        data: {
          quizId: newQuiz.id,
          title: rp.title,
          description: rp.description,
          type: rp.type,
          minScore: rp.minScore,
          maxScore: rp.maxScore,
          matchTags: JSON.stringify(rp.matchTags ?? []),
          productLimit: rp.productLimit ?? 4,
          layout: rp.layout ?? "grid",
          ctaText: rp.ctaText,
          position: rp.position,
        },
      });
    }

    return newQuiz;
  });

  return { quizId: quiz.id };
}

async function generateUniqueSlug(title: string, shop: string): Promise<string> {
  const base = title.toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z0-9]+/g, "-").replace(/^-|-$/g, "").slice(0, 60);
  let slug = base;
  let counter = 2;
  while (await db.quiz.findFirst({ where: { shop, slug } })) {
    slug = `${base}-${counter++}`;
  }
  return slug;
}
```

---

## ADMIN UI ROUTE

```tsx
// app/routes/app.quizzes.generate.tsx
import { json, redirect, type ActionFunctionArgs } from "@shopify/shopify-app-react-router";
import { useNavigation, Form } from "react-router";
import { useAppBridge } from "@shopify/app-bridge-react";
import { Page, Layout, Card, FormLayout, TextField, Select, Tag,
         Button, BlockStack, Text, Banner, InlineStack } from "@shopify/polaris";
import { authenticate } from "~/shopify.server";
import { generateQuizFromDescription } from "~/services/ai-quiz-builder.server";
import db from "~/db.server";

export async function loader({ request }: ActionFunctionArgs) {
  const { session } = await authenticate.admin(request);
  // Get product tags from synced products
  const products = await db.productMapping.findMany({
    where: { shop: session.shop, status: "active" },
    select: { tags: true },
  });
  const allTags = [...new Set(
    products.flatMap((p) => {
      try { return JSON.parse(p.tags) as string[]; }
      catch { return []; }
    })
  )];
  return json({ allTags });
}

export async function action({ request }: ActionFunctionArgs) {
  const { session } = await authenticate.admin(request);
  const formData = await request.formData();
  const description = formData.get("description") as string;
  const category = formData.get("category") as string;
  const quizType = formData.get("quizType") as string;
  const selectedTags = JSON.parse(formData.get("productTags") as string ?? "[]") as string[];

  try {
    const { quizId } = await generateQuizFromDescription(
      description, category, selectedTags, session.shop,
      quizType as "product-recommendation" | "personality" | "assessment"
    );
    return redirect(`/app/quizzes/${quizId}`);
  } catch (error) {
    return json({ error: error instanceof Error ? error.message : "Generation failed" }, { status: 500 });
  }
}
```

---

## SELF-VALIDATION CHECKLIST

- [ ] `authenticate.admin(request)` called first in every loader/action (Law 1)
- [ ] All DB queries scoped by `shop` (Law 2)
- [ ] Generated quiz always starts as `status: "draft"` (merchant reviews before publish)
- [ ] `$transaction` used for quiz + questions + answers + resultPages creation
- [ ] JSON fields safely stringified on create
- [ ] Unique slug generated per shop
- [ ] Error handling: AI failure returns clear error, never crashes quiz creation
- [ ] `npm run typecheck` — 0 errors

---

## NEVER

- Never publish AI-generated quiz automatically — always draft first
- Never trust AI response without JSON parse validation
- Never use product tags not in the store's actual tags list
- Never generate quizzes without a `shop` parameter
- Never skip error handling on the Anthropic API call

