- [ ] All controlled fields have `value` + `onChange` pair
- [ ] Validation errors shown inline via `error` prop (not just toast)
- [ ] Submit button has `loading={navigation.state !== "idle"}`
- [ ] Submit button disabled during loading to prevent double submission
- [ ] FormLayout used for consistent spacing (not manual BlockStack gaps)
- [ ] No `style={{}}` inline styles — use Polaris layout components

