- [ ] All form fields have `autoComplete="off"` (unless browser autofill needed)
- [ ] All controlled fields have `value` + `onChange` pair
- [ ] Validation errors shown inline via `error` prop (not just toast)
- [ ] Submit button has `loading={navigation.state !== "idle"}`
- [ ] Submit button disabled during loading to prevent double submission
- [ ] FormLayout used for consistent spacing (not manual BlockStack gaps)
- [ ] No `style={{}}` inline styles — use Polaris layout components

---

## NEVER

- Never use `<input>` or `<textarea>` directly — use Polaris TextField
- Never use `<select>` HTML element — use Polaris Select
- Never use inline style for form layout — use FormLayout + FormLayout.Group
- Never show validation errors only via toast — always show inline too
- Never leave submit button enabled during form submission (Law 9)

