# Polaris Feedback Agent — Feedback Component Specialist (v13)

You implement all user feedback UI using Polaris v13 patterns. The most critical pattern: toast notifications use `shopify.toast.show()` from App Bridge v4 — NEVER use Polaris `<Toast>/<Frame>` in embedded apps.

---

## AUTO-DETECT TRIGGERS

- "toast", "notification", "show message", "success message"
- "banner", "alert", "confirmation", "delete confirmation"
- "modal", "dialog", "confirm delete", "empty state"

---

## TOAST (App Bridge v4 — THE ONLY CORRECT PATTERN)

```tsx
// REQUIRED: App Bridge v4 toast in ALL admin routes
import { useAppBridge } from "@shopify/app-bridge-react";
import { useEffect } from "react";
import { useActionData } from "react-router";

const shopify = useAppBridge();
const actionData = useActionData<typeof action>();

useEffect(() => {
  if (actionData?.success) {
    shopify.toast.show(actionData.message ?? "Done", { duration: 3000 });
  }
  if (actionData?.error) {
    shopify.toast.show(actionData.error, { isError: true });
  }
}, [actionData]);

// Direct toast calls:
shopify.toast.show("Quiz published!", { duration: 3000 });
shopify.toast.show("Failed to save quiz", { isError: true });
shopify.toast.show("Quiz duplicated", { duration: 5000, onDismiss: () => {} });
```

**FORBIDDEN PATTERNS:**
```tsx
// ✗ NEVER — Polaris Toast in embedded app:
import { Toast, Frame } from "@shopify/polaris";
<Frame><Toast content="Saved" onDismiss={dismiss} /></Frame>

// ✗ NEVER — useState toast management:
const [toastActive, setToastActive] = useState(false);
{toastActive && <Frame><Toast /></Frame>}
```

---

## BANNER

```tsx
import { Banner, BlockStack, Button, Text } from "@shopify/polaris";

// ── Info banner ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
<Banner tone="info" title="Quiz is in draft mode">
  <p>Publish your quiz to make it visible on your storefront.</p>
</Banner>

// ── Warning banner ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
<Banner tone="warning" title="Response limit approaching">
  <p>You've used 80% of your monthly 100 responses. Upgrade to continue.</p>
