## NEVER

- Never call `JSON.parse()` without try/catch (Law 6)
- Never let external API failures (Klaviyo, Shopify) crash the main flow
- Never swallow errors silently — always log to console.error
- Never return raw database errors to the client (hide internals)
- Never throw in action functions — return json({ error }) instead
- Never forget CORS headers on error responses in public API routes

